  "tagline": "Open podcast search and directory API for the modern podcast ecosystem",
  "description": "Podcast Index provides a free, open API for searching and retrieving podcast metadata, episodes, and related data from a large independent podcast directory. It supports discovery, episode lookup, and Podcasting 2.0 features without relying on Apple's closed ecosystem.",
